msgstr "当前恢复事件"

msgid "DNS redirect destination ports"
msgstr "DNS 重定向目标端口"

msgid "DNS service port"
msgstr "DNS 服务端口"

msgid "DNS service ports must not overlap proxy ingress ports"
msgstr "DNS 服务端口不能与代理入口端口重叠"

msgid "Days of the week"
msgstr "星期"

msgid "Default template"
msgstr "默认模板"

msgid "Default: 53. Enter the actual port if existing DNS redirection uses another port. Only requests and replies redirected to local or allowed LAN DNS are exempt. DNS settings are unchanged. Do not overlap proxy ingress ports."
msgstr "默认 53。若现有 DNS 重定向使用其他端口，请填写实际端口；只保留重定向到本机或允许的局域网 DNS 的请求和回包，不修改 DNS 配置。不能与代理入口端口重叠。"

msgid "Delay before checks (seconds)"
msgstr "开始检测前等待（秒）"

msgid "Deny unlisted inbound connections"
msgstr "默认拒绝未列出的入站连接"

msgid "Detailed check logs"
msgstr "详细检测日志"

msgid "Detect one installed client automatically. When several are installed, select the client to monitor. This does not modify the client configuration."
msgstr "仅安装一个客户端时自动识别；安装多个时须指定监视对象。不会修改客户端配置。"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "已关闭"

msgid "Discover listening services automatically"
msgstr "自动发现监听服务"

msgid "Discovered listeners are candidates only; add a service rule to manage a port. Unrestricted rules add no source restriction and do not override the system firewall. Unsynchronized address families remain blocked for dynamic rules."
msgstr "发现的监听端口仅作为候选，添加服务规则后才纳入管理。“不限来源”不会覆盖系统防火墙规则。动态规则尚未同步的地址族仍被阻断。"

msgid "Dismiss"
msgstr "关闭"

msgid "Do not match IPv6 sources"
msgstr "不匹配 IPv6 来源"

msgid "Download configuration"
msgstr "下载配置"

msgid "Download local analysis report"
msgstr "下载本地分析报告"

msgid "Download report"
msgstr "下载报告"

msgid "Edit the complete UCI configuration for this plugin. Save stages changes; Save & Apply validates and activates them. Existing secret values are preserved by placeholders."
msgstr "可编辑本插件的完整 UCI 配置。保存仅暂存更改；保存并应用会校验并启用。已有敏感值以占位符保留。"

msgid "Enable after Save & Apply"
msgstr "保存并应用后启用"

msgid "Enable boot protection"
msgstr "启用开机保护"

msgid "Enable enhanced monitoring after recovery"
msgstr "恢复联网后加强监测"

msgid "Enable protection"
msgstr "启用保护功能"

msgid "Enable scheduled protection"
msgstr "启用定时保护"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "已启用"

msgid "End time"
msgstr "结束时间"

msgid "Enhanced checks are running; waiting for continuous stability"
msgstr "正在敏感检测，等待连续稳定"

msgid "Enhanced checks are running; waiting for proxy verification"
msgstr "正在敏感检测，等待代理验证通过"

msgid "Enhanced checks found an interruption; restarting the wait and stability checks"
msgstr "敏感检测发现中断，重新等待并确认稳定状态"

msgid "Enhanced monitoring after recovery"
msgstr "恢复后敏感观察"

msgid "Enhanced monitoring completed"
msgstr "稳定观察结束"

msgid "Enhanced monitoring duration (seconds)"
msgstr "加强监测时间（秒）"

msgid "Enhanced observation period (seconds)"
msgstr "敏感观察时间（秒）"

msgid "Enter IPv6 addresses or prefixes, or explicitly choose no IPv6 matching."
msgstr "请填写 IPv6 地址或前缀，或明确选择不匹配 IPv6。"

msgid "Enter a DNS target before enabling UDP checks"
msgstr "启用 UDP 检查须填写自己的 DNS 目标"

msgid "Enter a Worker HTTPS root URL without a path or credentials."
